  "description": "Typed, versioned, provider-neutral Agent Orchestration contract surface (W020): tenant-scoped plans with steps as typed action-proposal references, capability-scoped agent bindings, deterministic content-addressed plan compilation, retry policies as typed data, idempotency keys, sessions and proposal handoffs. JSON Schema projection under schemas/; runtime validators in @epoch/agent-orchestration.",
